WEBVTT

00:01.750 --> 00:07.560
In ancient China, there's a story of a beautiful lady named Chang'e living on the moon.

00:08.260 --> 00:15.950
Chang'e accidentally drank her husband's elixir of immortality, and was brought over to the heavens onto the moon.

00:16.600 --> 00:24.260
It's said that she is still living there and looking over her husband from afar, unable to return to Earth.

02:07.520 --> 02:10.740
Today's tea... is the royal milk tea.

02:10.740 --> 02:14.770
The strong smell of the Assam tea goes perfectly with the milk.

02:16.000 --> 02:19.650
It seems that you all managed to bring the Jewel of Virtue back in one piece.

02:19.650 --> 02:23.930
I ask you to stay like this in search of the next stone.

02:23.930 --> 02:26.220
Umm, Anzelotte-san?

02:26.220 --> 02:27.250
Yes?

02:27.770 --> 02:32.010
I... felt it... the next jewel...

02:32.010 --> 02:33.750
maybe it's on the moon...

02:33.750 --> 02:34.460
The moon?!

02:34.850 --> 02:38.380
The moon? The moon in the sky?

02:38.380 --> 02:39.000
Yes.

02:39.000 --> 02:41.970
So you also thought of the same thing?

02:42.390 --> 02:45.260
Do you have any reason for that?

02:45.260 --> 02:51.500
Our Longinus Team is currently searching for the whereabouts of the jewel there.

02:51.500 --> 02:57.440
Yesterday, we suddenly received a report from the
team while they were in the middle of their mission.

02:59.770 --> 03:02.780
This is their final recording of that moment.

03:04.500 --> 03:08.740
This is the Checkmate King 2, Bravo, respond!

03:09.940 --> 03:13.280
The team... was completely sieged!!

03:13.280 --> 03:14.720
WHAT?!

03:14.720 --> 03:17.760
Bravo, report your status!

03:18.260 --> 03:20.710
That's impossible... that's...

03:20.710 --> 03:23.640
It's coming! The white devil....!

03:25.290 --> 03:27.010
What happened?!

03:27.010 --> 03:28.000
BRAVO!

03:28.520 --> 03:32.350
It's impossible... "Usa" on the moon?!

03:37.010 --> 03:38.110
Usa!

03:40.230 --> 03:43.990
Bravo, respond!

03:43.990 --> 03:45.900
BRAVO!!!

03:48.010 --> 03:50.500
White... devil?

03:50.500 --> 03:51.580
Usa?

03:52.090 --> 03:55.250
The destination for your next mission will be the moon's surface.

03:55.250 --> 03:56.840
The Oriental Basin.

04:13.010 --> 04:14.750
Amazing...

04:14.750 --> 04:18.640
Anzelotte-san even has her own space shuttle.

04:18.640 --> 04:21.990
That is a Broom, not a shuttle.

04:21.990 --> 04:23.480
SilverStar.

04:23.480 --> 04:27.490
It's the standard type for a "safe return" flight navigation.

04:28.520 --> 04:31.730
I never expected we'd be riding that again.

04:31.730 --> 04:33.080
Yeah.

04:35.810 --> 04:43.220
Oji-sama, I am going to the moon, can you believe it?

04:43.780 --> 04:46.550
SilverStar, five seconds to take off...

04:47.000 --> 04:48.000
four...

04:48.000 --> 04:49.010
three...

04:49.010 --> 04:49.990
two...

04:49.990 --> 04:50.470
one...

05:13.620 --> 05:18.500
Wow, I never would have thought Japan was that small...

05:18.500 --> 05:22.900
Kimei Academy's Astronomy Club, now heading to space.

05:22.900 --> 05:26.580
The Broom does all the tedious controls for us.

05:26.580 --> 05:29.620
So let's sit back and enjoy looking at the planets.

05:29.620 --> 05:32.400
Hey, you have something you need to do, right?

05:32.400 --> 05:32.970
Huh?

05:36.090 --> 05:39.530
The 2nd year's final exam is just around the corner.

05:39.530 --> 05:43.610
Have you ever seen someone studying while on a trip like thi-

05:44.000 --> 05:46.240
The hipbone...

05:47.360 --> 05:51.370
Everyone's not only preparing for the mission, but also for their studies.

05:53.000 --> 05:54.700
I brought them with me.

05:56.110 --> 06:00.580
Chang'e finally fell, as the morning star settled down.

06:01.340 --> 06:04.300
Exactly, Chang'e would regret it.

06:04.300 --> 06:08.450
Umm... miracle drug...

06:08.450 --> 06:09.670
She stole.

06:10.350 --> 06:14.500
She hoped in her heart to return back.

06:14.500 --> 06:16.820
That's a Chinese folk tale, right?

06:16.820 --> 06:19.590
The story of Chang'e, the goddess of the moon.

06:19.590 --> 06:21.060
This is stupid.

06:21.060 --> 06:24.250
Don't tell me you've already given up, Hiiragi?

06:25.460 --> 06:30.250
It's the same test I took last year, no problem. No problem.

06:35.000 --> 06:39.900
Geez, what is he going to do if he really isn't able to graduate?

06:39.900 --> 06:43.590
Kureha-san, you're like Hiiragi-senpai's older sister.

06:43.590 --> 06:48.250
You'll end up like that if you have a childhood friend who doesn't grow up at all.

06:48.250 --> 06:53.510
Umm, have both of you rode a shuttle before?

06:53.510 --> 06:58.000
Y-Yeah, there was an incident involving an Emulator.

06:58.000 --> 07:00.440
And something bad happened.

07:01.450 --> 07:05.110
He came and helped me back then.

07:05.110 --> 07:13.500
He may be stupid, jinxed and a student dropout, but he comes in handy at times.

07:20.740 --> 07:22.320
That's that.

07:22.320 --> 07:25.580
Hiiragi! Wake up and study will you?!

07:25.580 --> 07:29.220
I'll tell everyone your embarassing secret if you don't.

07:29.220 --> 07:30.490
No, stop it!

07:30.490 --> 07:33.180
Now open up your textbook.

07:34.240 --> 07:37.500
A childhood friend...

07:43.870 --> 07:47.820
They really work hard to even take a trip to the moon.

07:48.270 --> 07:51.000
Is it okay to leave them?

07:51.000 --> 07:53.270
I'll spare the troublesome work.

07:53.270 --> 07:55.780
"It" is there on the moon, right?

07:56.760 --> 08:01.210
The moon is certainly an unreachable region for a long time now.

08:01.750 --> 08:06.440
It'll make our work easier if it kills Elis.

08:06.440 --> 08:09.260
It'll be great if they finish it off.

08:09.260 --> 08:12.130
But you will not let it go that way.

08:12.130 --> 08:13.910
Just like you said.

08:18.370 --> 08:22.760
What, you can't even do this problem?

08:22.760 --> 08:26.150
Then I guess that leaves me telling everyone your secret.

08:26.150 --> 08:30.750
Hey, why does my secret have anything to do with my studying?!

08:35.020 --> 08:36.740
What's wrong, Hiiragi?

08:40.160 --> 08:41.830
A rabbit?

08:47.620 --> 08:49.150
It's cute!

08:49.150 --> 08:52.630
It certainly is cute, but this is space, right?

08:55.630 --> 08:57.300
It is knocking at us.

08:57.300 --> 08:59.250
Rabbit's Mochitsuki?

08:59.250 --> 09:00.010
H-Hey!!

09:02.820 --> 09:03.810
We're surrounded.

09:13.150 --> 09:15.490
Don't tell me the white devil is...

09:16.000 --> 09:17.160
Them.

09:20.760 --> 09:22.760
It's no use, I can't control it.

09:22.760 --> 09:25.160
Mr. Rabbit, please stop it!

09:25.160 --> 09:28.080
They're destroying the ship, everyone head towards the escape Broom.

09:28.080 --> 09:29.960
It's too late!

09:44.250 --> 09:47.770
The shuttle SilverStar exploded en-route to the moon.

09:47.770 --> 09:50.360
Communication with the ship has been cut off!

09:50.360 --> 09:53.320
What? What happened?!

10:22.830 --> 10:26.200
I am... alive?

10:28.240 --> 10:32.310
That's right, my Kaguya and my Broom protected me.

10:34.260 --> 10:36.990
Hiiragi-senpai!!

10:36.990 --> 10:39.280
Kureha-san!!

10:39.280 --> 10:41.630
Akari-chan!!

10:51.180 --> 10:52.700
This feeling...

10:54.280 --> 10:56.460
The jewel is calling for me...

11:08.370 --> 11:10.510
The phone's not working...

11:10.510 --> 11:12.780
Must be an Emulator disrupting it.

11:17.010 --> 11:19.340
The outer edge of the Oriental Basin.

11:19.340 --> 11:21.480
What a weird place to fall onto.

11:22.180 --> 11:23.820
I guess walking is my only choice.

11:31.420 --> 11:34.670
It's not there, the jewel is this way.

11:48.250 --> 11:50.270
M-Mr. Rabbit?

12:17.510 --> 12:20.090
I have nowhere left to go... Oji-sama!!

12:53.840 --> 13:00.130
Geez, how dare he make me help her directly?! What is that Hiiragi Renji doing?!

13:01.080 --> 13:08.850
There are plenty of other great Wizards she could have called on, yet why does that Anzelotte let those useless brats do this?

13:08.850 --> 13:11.270
You're wrong.

13:11.270 --> 13:16.480
Hiiragi-senpai helped me out on many occasions, so did Kureha-san and Akari-chan!

13:16.480 --> 13:19.480
They are my precious friends who protect me.

13:26.580 --> 13:30.860
I'm sorry, I didn't intend to bad-mouth your friends.

13:30.860 --> 13:35.270
I just couldn't forgive them for allowing you to be in danger.

13:40.380 --> 13:42.770
This is as far I'll go to help you.

13:42.770 --> 13:45.090
Finish the mission, Elis.

13:47.120 --> 13:48.050
You are...?

13:53.230 --> 13:53.930
Wait!

13:57.110 --> 14:00.980
The jewel's presence... it's nearer now.

14:05.070 --> 14:06.200
Elis.

14:08.600 --> 14:10.280
Akari-chan...

14:10.280 --> 14:12.000
I'm sorry for not making it in time.

14:12.000 --> 14:12.830
Are you all right?

14:16.040 --> 14:19.500
Oji-sama, what does this mean?

14:33.260 --> 14:35.240
Geez, there's no end to them!

14:38.020 --> 14:38.850
Hiiragi!

14:38.850 --> 14:40.230
Kureha, you okay?!

14:40.230 --> 14:43.900
Of course, sorry, but can you handle them for a second?

14:50.460 --> 14:51.800
There it is!

14:59.260 --> 15:01.260
Hiiragi, grab on!

15:02.820 --> 15:05.460
Great, let's meet up with Elis then!

15:05.920 --> 15:07.240
Roger!

15:07.240 --> 15:09.300
So it's Hiiragi.

15:10.250 --> 15:11.670
Did you say something?!

15:11.670 --> 15:12.760
Nothing.

15:19.170 --> 15:19.940
That's...

15:20.380 --> 15:22.190
A man-made building.

15:27.320 --> 15:32.760
There is no doubt about it, I feel the jewel's presence in this area.

15:34.370 --> 15:35.830
A red moon?!

15:35.830 --> 15:39.100
How can that be? We ARE on the moon!

15:39.100 --> 15:43.290
The red moon is a completely different existence from our moon.

15:43.620 --> 15:51.300
It just informs us that Emulators will show their form when a red moon appears.

15:54.260 --> 15:57.970
Are you here to steal our treasure?

15:57.970 --> 15:59.180
You are...

15:59.680 --> 16:06.570
I am Chang'e, mistress of the moon, and the tool of Syaimaar.

16:06.570 --> 16:08.300
Syaimaar...

16:08.300 --> 16:10.770
Elis, step back.

16:10.770 --> 16:12.110
Yes.

16:15.580 --> 16:16.490
That's...!

16:25.120 --> 16:26.960
Let me give this back to you.

16:29.760 --> 16:30.840
Akari-chan!

16:37.690 --> 16:45.000
She already has two of the seven jewels? Truly suited for Syaimaar-sama.

16:46.010 --> 16:50.400
Young girl, do you think your bullet can win against our sword?

17:06.780 --> 17:09.320
A huge magical power reaction has been detected on the moon's surface!

17:09.320 --> 17:11.210
Show it on the monitor.

17:13.030 --> 17:15.800
That is an Emulator? It can't be!

17:17.250 --> 17:18.300
She's huge!

17:18.300 --> 17:21.280
Looks like she's the boss here.

17:22.000 --> 17:22.680
Akari!

17:23.350 --> 17:25.120
Akari, where's Elis?!

17:25.120 --> 17:27.000
Inside that thing.

17:37.260 --> 17:41.660
What will you do, Elis, in this situation?

17:43.880 --> 17:48.260
Now I have three of the seven jewels in my hands now!

17:50.240 --> 17:53.340
How are we supposed to go against that thing?!

17:53.340 --> 17:56.470
That is not just another giant Emulator.

17:57.650 --> 18:01.850
That huge body is probably another Lunar Casket.

18:01.850 --> 18:07.060
You're saying that Elis and that Emulator's real body are in there?

18:13.000 --> 18:13.780
I'm going.

18:13.780 --> 18:14.990
Hiiragi...

18:15.500 --> 18:18.790
Kureha and Akari, concentrate your attack on one spot of its body.

18:18.790 --> 18:23.810
I'll break through it with my sword once the barrier starts to fall.

18:23.810 --> 18:24.870
Roger!

18:28.540 --> 18:30.280
Just a little bit longer.

18:30.280 --> 18:34.380
Just a little bit longer and "he" will return to us!

18:54.730 --> 18:57.260
ELIS!!!

18:59.210 --> 19:01.700
Hiiragi-senpai...

19:12.080 --> 19:16.210
Don't interfere with me, menial wizard!

19:17.300 --> 19:21.890
Your sword won't work on us, borrower of the jewel's power.

19:25.480 --> 19:26.310
Elis, are you okay?!

19:28.000 --> 19:30.940
Is this the time to worry about others?

19:30.940 --> 19:31.810
Child!

19:32.470 --> 19:37.480
I'll offer both of your lives to Syaimaar-sama!

19:43.140 --> 19:46.910
No, that is my light.

19:55.480 --> 19:58.280
That is my light.

20:05.000 --> 20:08.710
Return to me, my light.

20:09.480 --> 20:10.430
What?!

20:21.000 --> 20:22.400
T-This can't be?!

20:22.870 --> 20:25.620
What are you, child?!

20:29.010 --> 20:30.870
Unleash Magical Aura!

20:36.090 --> 20:39.840
You, even without the jewel... the likes of you can't defeat me.

20:39.840 --> 20:43.200
I'll put you back in line to Rikai!

20:44.460 --> 20:45.890
Stupid child!

20:55.570 --> 21:00.290
No... I haven't met him yet...

21:01.240 --> 21:04.490
Syai... maar... sama...

21:19.820 --> 21:22.290
Elis, Elis!

21:25.040 --> 21:27.510
Hiiragi-senpai?

21:27.510 --> 21:29.500
Where am I?

21:29.500 --> 21:30.750
Can you stand?

21:32.110 --> 21:35.010
Did I trouble you again?

21:35.010 --> 21:36.400
Elis-chan!

21:36.400 --> 21:38.900
Kureha-san! Akari-chan!

21:40.000 --> 21:41.670
I'm glad you're all right.

21:41.670 --> 21:42.870
As am I seeing all of you.

21:42.870 --> 21:44.510
Did you find the jewel?

21:44.510 --> 21:47.010
Yeah, look at her bracelet.

21:51.010 --> 21:52.870
That makes it the third!

21:52.870 --> 21:55.500
Elis took it from the witch herself.

21:55.920 --> 21:58.000
Not that you remember it, I presume.

21:58.000 --> 22:00.750
Geez, you were making me worried back there.

22:05.530 --> 22:06.680
You!

22:06.680 --> 22:08.340
Who are you?

22:08.340 --> 22:14.180
Hiiragi Renji, I am anxious about your future looking at your performance just now.

22:14.180 --> 22:15.280
What?!

22:15.280 --> 22:17.230
So are the other two.

22:17.230 --> 22:21.000
I sure hope you'll show something worthy of your mission.

22:21.000 --> 22:23.820
Who the hell are you, coming here and talking big?!

22:26.240 --> 22:28.260
You bastard!

22:28.770 --> 22:29.740
Elis-chan?!

22:31.160 --> 22:34.540
Umm... Thank you.

22:37.870 --> 22:42.010
I didn't get to say thank you for saving me back then.

22:49.320 --> 22:51.760
Wait, what is your name?

22:52.480 --> 22:54.100
Kirihito.

22:58.280 --> 23:02.360
Huh? Isn't that our academy's uniform?

23:02.360 --> 23:04.200
A Wizard from there?

23:04.200 --> 23:06.300
Who knows. Never seen him before.

23:07.280 --> 23:09.450
Nasty brat.

24:50.690 --> 24:54.330
Oji-sama, I've met quite a wonderful guy.

24:54.330 --> 24:57.010
His name is Ando Kurusu-san.

24:57.010 --> 25:00.560
He is the only wizard who is protecting the fourth jewel.

25:00.560 --> 25:04.810
But Kurusu-san is quite the prankster.

25:04.810 --> 25:06.690
I feel sorry for Hiiragi-senpai...

25:07.100 --> 25:12.070
Next time, on Night Wizard THE ANIMATION, Solitary Island, the Two Swordmasters.

25:12.070 --> 25:14.280
Damn it, why can't I beat him?!
